{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101964","id":2295028348,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6Iy1p8","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101964","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101964.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101964.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101964","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101964/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101964/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101964/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/b28d6d1fa3d0119b06952835fcb9882be91f837c","number":101964,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Don't inline certain functions for smaller binary size","user":{"login":"YYF233333","id":67693830,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NjkzODMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67693830?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333","html_url":"https://github.com/YYF233333","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"AFAIK godot has a long standing issue that its binary size is too big for web platform which leads to slow starup time. See https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/68647 for more details. I profile the binary size a bit with [SizeBench](https://github.com/microsoft/SizeBench) and apply several suggestions.\r\n\r\nWhat I have done:\r\n- no inline `String::~String()`(\\~-5MB), `StringName:~StringName`(\\~-1MB), `_err_print_error`(\\~-200KB)\r\n- Make `_FORCE_INLINE_` a no-op.\r\n- ~remove unused `virtual` qualifier for `Object::call_const` (\\~-10KB) (I wonder if this can be automated, some of these functions are configuration-dependent, e.g. `Object::setvar()` overriden on web but not on Windows. Manually doing this is time-consuming and prone to errors.)(These unused virtuals waste approximately 2.8MB of space in total.)~\r\n\r\nThese changes are guarded by a `SIZE_EXTRA` macro and can be enabled by passing `optimize=size_extra` from cmd.\r\n\r\nResult(Web Release):\r\ncompile with `scons p=web target=template_release optimize=size_extra production=yes`\r\n- godot.wasm\r\n    - master 41,664,454 bytes\r\n    - this PR 30,784,747 bytes\r\n- the whole zip package\r\n    - master 9,421,090 bytes\r\n    - this PR 8,706,984 bytes\r\n\r\nPerformance impact: 5%~10%, measured by godot-benchmark exported to web. https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101964#issuecomment-2613820912","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777